{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16318470","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16318470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1631847001:1":{"text":"ご覧ください。これが最新モデルの「スター＆ムーン」です。","source_cn":"你看看，这是不是最新款的星月同行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC524CCB85829DB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631847002:1":{"text":"本当だ……限定モデルで、すでに完売したと聞いてたんですが……","source_cn":"还真是哎，这件不是限量发售，已经卖完了么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212C3B8AB78DD1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631847003:1":{"text":"フッ……うちには独自の仕入れルートがあるんですよ。","source_cn":"呵呵，我当然是有自己的渠道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x779744F4EF0E552E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631847004:1":{"text":"じゃあもしかして、先月から入手困難な「翠湖の雫」のマントも？","source_cn":"好厉害，那上个月最火的翠湖之心披风，您这里也有么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ACF98A5F1CFCA55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631847005:1":{"text":"もちろんあります。それどころか、今ならセットで二割引きですよ！","source_cn":"有，当然有。不仅如此，这两件现在一起买可以打八折！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB473D068210F0E16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"